# @headless
# Fresh NEWWORLD, 08:00. Use gothic-body-runner --game-parity --step-ms 8.
# Start at the standard forest view and look away from Khorinis. Return to the barracks and market.
# NPC CPU windows are steady..return, return..arrived, and arrived..end.
seed 73106
cheat god
world-check NEWWORLD.ZEN
goto NW_FOREST_PATH_16
watch player
cam at 18605 2100 14875 19700 2220 16000
mark warm
wait 6000
mark steady
wait 8000
mark return
cam follow 500 220 180
route 500 NW_FOREST_PATH_16 NW_CITY_HABOUR_KASERN_18 NW_CITY_MERCHANT_PATH_17
mark arrived
wait 4000
mark end
